    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161280/extras/0a0c8d6f3439f4d9ff98753b37f88cfd.avif?t=1751824249\" width=626 height=176 /></span><strong>Dive into a unique and relaxing experience with Cozy Garden</strong>, a game that combines the best of resource management, strategy, and <i>Creature Collector</i> elements, all at the bottom of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Garden</strong> allows you to manage your farm and take care of adorable guinea pigs while doing your daily tasks. The game occupies the bottom of your screen, allowing you to play while you browse the web, work, study, watch videos, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break and just sit and relax watching your guinea pigs work and live in your little world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161280/extras/daa1b98a302eff47d63e7a138dc72b61.poster.avif?t=1751824249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161280/extras/daa1b98a302eff47d63e7a138dc72b61.webm?t=1751824249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161280/extras/daa1b98a302eff47d63e7a138dc72b61.mp4?t=1751824249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cozy Garden</strong>, your guinea pigs are more than just companions \u2013 they\u2019re your partners in building and managing a thriving farm. Care for, feed, and play with your pets to keep them happy and healthy. Plus, as a <i>Creature Collector</i>, you\u2019ll be able to gather a wide variety of unique creatures by placing different combinations of ingredients onto the Pet Summoning Platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your charming little farm and rely on your guinea pigs to handle the daily tasks. Expand your land to discover new areas, build a variety of structures to ensure your guinea pigs remain happy and healthy, and customize your farm to reflect your unique style. Plant crops, gather resources, and create the perfect environment for your guinea pigs to thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow your farm, unlock new features, upgrades, and challenges that will keep you engaged. Shape your farm into a vibrant and lively place, where every pet has a role and every corner reflects your personal touch. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161280/extras/0a0c8d6f3439f4d9ff98753b37f88cfd.avif?t=1751824249\" width=626 height=176 /></span><strong>Dive into a unique and relaxing experience with Cozy Garden</strong>, a game that combines the best of resource management, strategy, and <i>Creature Collector</i> elements, all at the bottom of your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Garden</strong> allows you to manage your farm and take care of adorable guinea pigs while doing your daily tasks. The game occupies the bottom of your screen, allowing you to play while you browse the web, work, study, watch videos, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break and just sit and relax watching your guinea pigs work and live in your little world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161280/extras/daa1b98a302eff47d63e7a138dc72b61.poster.avif?t=1751824249\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161280/extras/daa1b98a302eff47d63e7a138dc72b61.webm?t=1751824249\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3161280/extras/daa1b98a302eff47d63e7a138dc72b61.mp4?t=1751824249\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cozy Garden</strong>, your guinea pigs are more than just companions \u2013 they\u2019re your partners in building and managing a thriving farm. Care for, feed, and play with your pets to keep them happy and healthy. Plus, as a <i>Creature Collector</i>, you\u2019ll be able to gather a wide variety of unique creatures by placing different combinations of ingredients onto the Pet Summoning Platform.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your charming little farm and rely on your guinea pigs to handle the daily tasks. Expand your land to discover new areas, build a variety of structures to ensure your guinea pigs remain happy and healthy, and customize your farm to reflect your unique style. Plant crops, gather resources, and create the perfect environment for your guinea pigs to thrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you grow your farm, unlock new features, upgrades, and challenges that will keep you engaged. Shape your farm into a vibrant and lively place, where every pet has a role and every corner reflects your personal touch. </p>",
    "short_description": "Help adorable guinea pigs manage their farm and expand their family in a farming simulation that combines resource management and pet care. This cozy game runs at the bottom of your screen, providing a quick break that lets you stay productive.",
